{
  "about": "How the map names and sorts the renderer's products. favourite_patterns: the maps a forecast opens on and lists first, in order; each pattern matches part of a product folder name. names: a plain name for a product folder. groups: the headings of the map list, first match wins; a heading marked last is listed at the end. thumbnail_patterns: the look a forecast shows in the list, first one it has. Adding a map is a line here, not code. kinds: the headings the Files page sorts pictures under, the same first-match rule; raw_prefix marks the model's own fields.",
